ook:Pepper|black pepper]]\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] dried [[Cookbook:Rosemary|rosemary]]\n* 2 tbsp [[Cookbook:Cayenne Pepper|cayenne pepper]]\n* 1 tsp freshly-ground [[Cookbook:Cinnamon|cinnamon]]\n* 3 tbsp dehydrated [[Cookbook:Lemon|lemon]] peel\n* 5 boneless skinless [[Cookbook:Chicken#Breast|chicken breasts]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] [[Cookbook:Dijon Mustard|Dijon mustard]]\n\n== Procedure ==\n#Combine paprikas, salt, pepper, rosemary, cayenne, cinnamon, and lemon peel. Set aside.\n#Rub mustard all over chicken. Apply seasoning mixture, and press lightly to aid adhesion.\n#Grill on a preheated charcoal [[Cookbook:Grill|grill]], turning often, until internal temperature reaches 165°F.\n#Remove and let rest for 3 minutes. Serve.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using chicken breast]]\n[[Category:Grilled recipes]]\n[[Category:Main course recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using ground cinnamon]]\n[[Category:Recipes using paprika]]\n[[Category:Recipes using rosemary]]\n[[Category:Recipes using Dijon mustard]]\n[[Category:Recipes using dehydrated lemon zest]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cayenne]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Spice Rubbed Grilled Chicken Breast","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"2 tbsp paprika","sourceText":"2 tbsp paprika","amountText":"2 tbsp paprika","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"3 tbsp smoked paprika","sourceText":"3 tbsp smoked paprika","amountText":"3 tbsp smoked paprika","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"1 tbsp salt","sourceText":"1 tbsp salt","amountText":"1 tbsp salt","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"1 tbsp freshly ground black pepper","sourceText":"1 tbsp freshly ground black pepper","amountText":"1 tbsp freshly ground black pepper","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"2 tsp dried rosemary","sourceText":"2 tsp drie